Z||000013||stsmithgt||08-15-2000||05:08 PM||||Instead of adding metalic,  That red can be coated with a pearl to give it a wet look with lots of depth.  Adding a little of the red to the pearl makes it look like you could dab your finger right into the fender once it's buffed out a little.  My brother painted the tail of his motorcylce a bright red, but he put a little lazor blue in the pearl and man does it look sweet.  I haven't seen a picture that gives that paintjob justice yet.  It's too 3-D to stand out on a piece of paper(it changes to holographic graphics on the tank and bodywork in the front.(depositing 2 cents) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
